{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-12-02 22:30:00', 'title': 'INTEL OPENS NEW DESIGN & ENGINEERING CENTRE', 'text': "INTEL ANNOUNCED THE OPENING OF ITS NEW DESIGN AND ENGINEERING CENTRE IN HYDERABAD. SPREAD OVER 3,00,000 SQ FT THE INNOVATION CENTRE WILL HAVE A CAPACITY TO HOUSE AROUND 1500 ENGINEERS. CURRENTLY, INTEL HAS AROUND 380 ENGINEERS WORKING OUT OF THE NEW CENTRE. ACCORDING TO INTEL, THE WORLD-SCALE DESIGN AND ENGINEERING CENTRE WILL MAKE SIGNIFICANT CONTRIBUTIONS TO CRITICAL GLOBAL PRODUCTS AND TECHNOLOGIES ACROSS NEXT GENERATION SOCS (SYSTEM ON A CHIP), GRAPHICS, HARDWARE PLATFORMS AND SOFTWARE TO FUEL INTEL'S GROWTH. INTERESTINGLY, THE 105 ENGINEERS THAT INTEL HAD ACQUI-HIRED FROM CITY-BASED FABLESS SEMICONDUCTOR PLAYER INEDA SYSTEMS FOR THEIR SKILLS IN GRAPHICS EARLIER THIS YEAR WILL ALSO BE HOUSED IN THIS CENTRE."}{'symbol': 'INTC', 'date': '2019-12-01 22:30:00', 'title': 'APPLE INC. (NASDAQGS:AAPL) COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF MAJORITY STAKE IN SMARTPHONE MODEM BUSINESS FROM INTEL CORPORATION (NASDAQGS:INTC).', 'text': 'APPLE INC. (NASDAQGS:AAPL) SIGNED AN AGREEMENT TO ACQUIRE MAJORITY STAKE IN SMARTPHONE MODEM BUSINESS FROM INTEL CORPORATION (NASDAQGS:INTC) IN A TRANSACTION VALUED AT $1 BILLION ON JULY 25, 2019. APPROXIMATELY 2,200 INTEL EMPLOYEES WILL JOIN APPLE, ALONG WITH INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY, EQUIPMENT AND LEASES. THE TRANSACTION IS SUBJECT TO REGULATORY APPROVALS AND OTHER CUSTOMARY CONDITIONS, INCLUDING WORKS COUNCIL AND OTHER RELEVANT CONSULTATIONS IN CERTAIN JURISDICTIONS AND IS EXPECTED TO CLOSE IN THE FOURTH QUARTER OF 2019. GENE SYKES, TAMMY KIELY, PAWAN TEWARI AND KYLE JESSEN OF GOLDMAN SACHS & CO. LLC ACTED AS FINANCIAL ADVISORS TO INTEL. SKADDEN, ARPS, SLATE, MEAGHER & FLOM LLP AND SULLIVAN CROMWELL LLP SERVED AS LEGAL ADVISORS TO INTEL.\nAPPLE INC. (NASDAQGS:AAPL) COMPLETED THE ACQUISITION OF MAJORITY STAKE IN SMARTPHONE MODEM BUSINESS FROM INTEL CORPORATION (NASDAQGS:INTC) ON DECEMBER 2, 2019.\n'}